OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Pan mansion cafe forced to
OL,4,Aclose after just over a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe and restaurant in part of the
OL,7,Fmansion which helped to inspire the
OL,8,FPeter Pan story has shut after a little
OL,9,Fover a year.
OL,11,FPan's Cafe opened at Moat Brae in
OL,12,FDumfries last summer about 12 months
OL,13,Fafter the site had closed as a centre
OL,14,Ffor children's literature.
OL,16,FHowever, owner Curtis Silver said
OL,17,Fincreasing financial pressures, rising
OL,18,Ftaxation and operating costs had led to
OL,19,Fthe decision to shut being taken with a
OL,20,F"heavy heart".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
